  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "These sources are a season report, a council work session transcript and a survey about the Cedar Hollow Winter Warming Center.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Cedar Hollow Winter Warming Center: Season Report, 2025-26”",
            "source_id": "s_669165f94068"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[0:04]",
            "source_id": "s_7d69ee06e962"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P11",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_9c2285203a5a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The center was open 87 nights and recorded 2,914 overnight stays by 412 different guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What the center did”",
            "source_id": "s_669165f94068"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The season cost $318,400, paid by the city, a $80,000 county grant and private donations.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What it cost”",
            "source_id": "s_669165f94068"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Staff recommend opening on November 15 and adding an east side site, which would add $142,000.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Recommendations for next season”",
            "source_id": "s_669165f94068"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[1:02]",
            "source_id": "s_7d69ee06e962"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the survey, 74 percent of guests said the walk or ride was the hardest part of getting there.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P13",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_9c2285203a5a"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "On January 21, 61 guests filled a hall set up for 60. Will a 35-degree trigger and a November 15 opening strain that space even more?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Recommendations for next season”",
            "source_id": "s_669165f94068"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[0:04]",
            "source_id": "s_7d69ee06e962"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Volunteers gave 3,260 hours at one site, and 88 percent plan to return. Can they also staff a second site and get the medical training they asked for?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Volunteers”",
            "source_id": "s_669165f94068"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P15",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_9c2285203a5a"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
    ],
